    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Prof. Thor I Fossen",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Department of Engineering Cybernetics",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/e29b613ed08a3f4363bdbd18f84ff9baef4b407f0950166ce6b405c5c0a30cbe.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "State of the art",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- Manoeuvres are generally performed in calm waters close to ports, but some times are also performed at sea in higher sea states."
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- This requires models which can handle manoeuvring and seakeeping."
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- The hydrodynamic problem is very complex, and we may still be a long time away from a solution."
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- The state of the art uses a combination of manoeuvring and seakeeping models via either"
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- Motion superposition",
            "- Force superposition"
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Frequency-domain seakeeping models",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "These models can be used to simulate wave-induced ship motion time series:",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Motion superposition model",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/2f9ca280f07042b6ff08fc0260a6f691a425a15a368e830b635ecf2f576c77e5.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Motion superposition model",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- Commonly used in control applications: autopilot, manoeuvring, formation control, rudder roll stabilisation."
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- The rationale behind this is that a wave filter rejects the 1st order wave induced motion, and no memory effects are then considered."
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- It can be a good assumption in lower sea states."
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Force superposition model",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Time-domain SK model + nonlinearities.",
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Force superposition model",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- This is an attempt to obtain a unified model for manoeuvring in a seaway."
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- Fluid memory effects are incorporated, together with other non-linear effects characteristic of manoeuvring: lift-drag, cross-flow drag."
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- These models are based on the Cummins Equation expressed in terms of body-fixed coordinates, and the nonlinear effects are added."
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- The Centripetal-Coriollis terms still remain an issue."
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "list_items": [
            "- This model is valid provided that the vessel manoeuvres slowly—because part of the model is based on a seakeeping model."
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Kinematic transformations {s}-{b}",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Following Perez & Fossen (2007)",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In {n},",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "<number>",
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Kinematic transformations {s}-{b}",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Taking the time-derivative",
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Taking it to {b},",
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "06/06/26",
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "One-day Tutorial, CAMS'07, Bol, Croatia",
        "page_idx": 8
    },
